;
; dungeon_a.tres — Deep dungeon variant A.
; Rectangular stone room with cobble walls, iron veins, diamond_ore centrepiece.
; Palette: stone/cobblestone natural, iron_ore/diamond_ore natural, dark-grey (2) floor.
; Contains bronze chest in centre.
; DOCS.md §2 — dungeon structure; CONTEXT.md D-08 (rare, deep underground).
; allowed_biomes = [] means any biome — placement gated by depth in structure_placer.

[ext_resource type="Script" path="res://src/bricks/brick_template.gd" id="1_btmpl"]

